abstract: >-
  Paper, Lean 4 checks and Julia verification suite. Every packing of unit
  balls in R^4 has density below 0.630996; the twenty-four-cell bound is
  proved in the cases listed in the paper, and the remaining cases with 24 to
  27 near neighbours are open.
